      "type": "pagehead",
      "title": "Ribbons",
      "lead": "Explore the colors and causes behind solidarity ribbons. Choose a ribbon below to learn about its meanings, including how we use it in Colors of Support.",
      "body": [
        "Choose a cause you want to support and wear a ribbon on your backpack or jacket. A ribbon can show solidarity without sharing a personal story.",
        "Email our team to check current pickup locations and available colors."
      ],
